     "Buri inyuma y'imbuga zizewe, mobile money, porogaramu z'ubutumwa n'amagambo y'ibanga. Koresha ibikoresho bisanzwe byizewe, ntukihimbire uburyo bwawe bwo guhisha amakuru y'ukuri.",
