     "Ni ugutobanya amakuru asomeka ukayahindura kode idasomeka ukoresheje urufunguzo, kugira ngo uyafashe cyangwa uyibye atayasobanukirwa nta rufunguzo.",
     "Rukoreshwa n'agakingirizo (padlock) ko muri browser, WhatsApp, porogaramu za banki na telefone zifunze. Fungura encryption kuri telefone na mudasobwa, ukunde imbuga zitangirana na https.",
